(b)to adimit as members of the Association those beliveand accept the full Gospel of our Lord Jesus Christas written in the Holy Scriptures and who claim ourLord Jesus Christ as their personal saviour;

(c)to assist members of the association to worship ourLord Jesus Christ, as an assembly of believers,gathered together (in spirit and in truth) as iscommanded in the word of God in the HolyScriptures;

(d)to enable members of the association to worship ourLord Jesus Christ, as an assembly of believersgathered together (in spirit and in truth) as iscommanded in the word of God in the HolyScriptures;

(e)to enable members of the association to claim fullsalvation including salvation from sin, sickness andsuffering and thereby assisting such members toprosper spiritually by caliming all the promises ofour Lord Jesus Christ as is found in the HolyScriptures;

(f)to establish Sunday Schools, Bible Colleges, Retreatand Conference Centres and Discipleship TrainingCentres for members who believe and are committedto spread Chirstian evangelism by Biblicaldisciplining and Christian church planting ascommissioned and commanded in the Book of Actsof the Holy Scripture according to Paul;

(f)to establish Sunday Schools, Bible Colleges, Retreatand Conference Centres and Discipleship TrainingCentres for members who believe and are committedto spread Chirstian evangelism by Biblicaldisciplining and Christian church planting ascommissioned and commanded in the Book of Actsof the Holy Scripture according to Paul;

