(9)None of the members could acquire any personalbenefits through the membership of the Foundation.

6.(i)A child member has to pay Rs. 1/- per year forthe membership.

(ii)a youth member has to pay Rs. 6/- per year forthe membership.

(iii)an ordinary member has to pay Rs. 24/- peryear for the membership.

(iv)the membership obtained by paying Rs. 240/-or paying the said amount in 3 installmentswithin a year, is considered as a lifetime member.

