(b)to develop bilateral relations between Botswanaand Sri Lanka by promoting cultural, social andeconomic exchanges between the two countries;

(c)to engage in activities for poor relief and theeradcation of poverty;

(d)to provide financial assistance and to awardscholarships and bursaries to the deserving studentsto the University of Botswana and the Universityof Colombo;

(e)to provide assistance and relief during the naturaldisasters;

(f)to work toward the eliminiation of all termsdiscrimination amongst the people and uphold theRule of Law;

(g)to support women and children for the upliftmentof their lives;

(h)to establish and maintain youth hostels, medicalcentres and hospices;

(i)to establish internet international communicationsand radio stations for disseminatio of knowledge;

(j)to assist the government in its efforts to improvethe livings condition fo the people;

(k)to engage in disaste relief and reconstruction;

(l)to establish medical aid and legal aid schemes forthe welfare of people; and

(m)to do all such other thisgs as may be necessary orconducive to the accomplishment of the objects ofthe Corporation.

